a)     the engineering fees for Development Engineering (London) Limited BE INCREASED to recognize the additional scope of work for the project, in accordance with the estimate on file, by $29,913 (excluding HST), from $78,890 to a total upset amount of $108,803, in accordance with Section 15.2 (g) of the Procurement of Goods and Services Policy;

